/// Minimal `dart:js_interop` bindings for `@mlc-ai/web-llm` loaded from CDN.
///
/// `web/index.html` exposes the library as `window.webllm` via an ES-module
/// import (`https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@mlc-ai/web-llm@0.2.84/+esm`) and
